{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40672","headline":"吊郑宾客 · 李洞","name":"吊郑宾客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝行丧名节，岳色惨天风。\n待漏秋吟断，焚香夜直空。\n骨寒依壠草，家尽逐边鸿。\n一吊知音後，归来碎峄桐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}